    "answer": {
      "short": "$a>b$.\n\nWrite both numbers with base $2$: $a=2^{81}$ and $b=2^{18}$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}a&=2^{3^4}\\\\a&=2^{81}\\\\b&=4^{3^2}\\\\b&=(2^2)^9\\\\b&=2^{18}\\end{align*}$$\nSince $2>1$ and $81>18$, $a>b$.",
